# Brygid the Stylist Returns (bastok 74): a trade while accepted before an option is kept. A MNK 75 who has completed
# Brygid the Stylist, the Temple Crown worn: 380 (the requests), accepted. The Aries Subligar traded at Option 0: the
# trade answers nothing (user ruling 2026-11-05, kept bugs: the Lua's trade handler indexed optionToItems[0], nil,
# and raised; the Lua baseline, 3c4c08d2, has an expect-error on each trade), so nothing plays and the subligar
# stays; 381 (the requests not worn); the same trade answers nothing again.
char zone=BastokMarkets pos=-90.2,-4.302,-107.5 job=MNK lvl=75
quest Bastok.BrygidTheStylist completed
item TempleCrown
item AriesSubligar
login
equip TempleCrown Head
trigger Brygid                  # the Temple Crown worn: 380 (robe 0, the requests, MNK)
finish                          # accepted (deleted, then begun)
trade Brygid AriesSubligar x1   # Option 0: no option kept, nothing
trigger Brygid                  # Option 0, the requests not worn: 381
finish
trade Brygid AriesSubligar x1   # nothing again; the subligar stays
